@rekram1-node Ah, I see. So it's an approach to token optimisation that makes perfect sense overall, but in Copilot it shouldn't matter whether Opus writes the title and responds to the prompt IF this happens within the same request and not in two separate requests, right?

What configurations do you need?
I can already provide you with my opencode.json, but if you need more information, please let me know.

``` json
